---
import { sitePath } from '../lib/site-path';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import '../styles/about-studio.css';
---
<Base title="没有找到页面" noindex>
 <div class="shell studio-lost" data-studio-lost>
  <section class="studio-lost__opening" aria-labelledby="lost-title">
   <div class="studio-lost__copy"><h1 id="lost-title" aria-label="404"><span>4</span><span>0</span><span>4</span></h1><h2>这条路，先到这里。</h2><p>这个地址还没有工程。可以从工程库继续探索。</p></div>
   <nav class="studio-lost__routes" aria-label="继续探索的入口">
    <a class="studio-lost__route-link studio-lost__route-link--primary" href={sitePath('/projects/')}><span>打开工程库</span><code>{sitePath('/projects/')}</code><Icon size={26}/></a>
    <a class="studio-lost__route-link" href={sitePath('/')}><span>回到首页</span><code>{sitePath('/')}</code><Icon name="back" size={24}/></a>
   </nav>
   <div class="studio-lost__camera" data-studio-region>
    <div class="studio-lost__drawing" data-studio-plane aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 700 570" fill="none"><path class="studio-lost__paper-depth" d="M155 57L574 100L600 420L337 535L118 398Z"/><path class="studio-lost__paper" d="M139 43L558 86L583 406L321 521L102 384Z"/><path class="studio-lost__line" d="M174 143L363 163M185 178L426 203M194 213L339 228"/><path class="studio-lost__route" d="M28 334C134 267 203 371 290 310L337 273M366 250L421 213C471 179 525 238 641 174"/><circle cx="337" cy="273" r="7"/><path class="studio-lost__fold" d="M396 488L458 443L583 406"/></svg></div>
   </div>
  </section>
 </div>
</Base>

